  "snp1.8:0.2": "<p><i>(This sutta is identical with <a href='https://www.dhammatalks.org/suttas/KN/Khp/khp9.html'>Khp 9</a>.)</i></p><p>See also: <a href='https://suttacentral.net/mn52'>MN 52</a>; <a href='https://suttacentral.net/mn97'>MN 97</a>; <a href='https://suttacentral.net/mn135'>MN 135</a>; <a href='https://suttacentral.net/sn42.8'>SN 42:8</a>; <a href='https://suttacentral.net/sn46.54'>SN 46:54</a>; SN 55:7; <a href='https://suttacentral.net/an3.65'>AN 3:66</a>; <a href='https://suttacentral.net/an4.67'>AN 4:67</a>; <a href='https://suttacentral.net/an4.96'>AN 4:96</a>; <a href='https://suttacentral.net/an4.125'>AN 4:125–126</a>; <a href='https://suttacentral.net/an4.178'>AN 4:178</a>; <a href='https://suttacentral.net/an4.200'>AN 4:200</a>; <a href='https://suttacentral.net/an5.20'>AN 5:20</a>; <a href='https://suttacentral.net/an5.27'>AN 5:27</a>; <a href='https://suttacentral.net/an6.12'>AN 6:12–13</a>; <a href='https://suttacentral.net/an8.63'>AN 8:70</a>; AN 10:176; <a href='https://suttacentral.net/an10.219'>AN 10:196</a>; <a href='https://suttacentral.net/an11.15'>AN 11:16</a>; <a href='https://suttacentral.net/ud5.1'>Ud 5:1</a>; <a href='https://suttacentral.net/iti22'>Iti 22</a>; <a href='https://suttacentral.net/iti27'>Iti 27</a></p>",
